Q1. Run Apache Pod
Bash

kubectl run apache-pod --image=httpd
kubectl get pods
kubectl describe pod apache-pod

Q2. Apache Deployment
Bash

kubectl create deployment apache-deployment --image=httpd
kubectl get deployments
kubectl get pods

Q3. Scale Replicas
Bash

# Scale up
kubectl scale deployment apache-deployment --replicas=4
kubectl get rs
# Scale down
kubectl scale deployment apache-deployment --replicas=2
kubectl get pods

Q4. Deployment YAML (apache-deployment.yaml)
YAML

apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: apache-yaml-deployment
spec:
  replicas: 3
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: apache
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: apache
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: apache-container
        image: httpd
        ports:
        - containerPort: 80

Apply and Verify:
Bash

kubectl apply -f apache-deployment.yaml
kubectl get all

